
HOST_TX !s
[LINK] STOP
[FIELD] STOP
[LINK] STOP

HOST_TX x
[LINK] port=usb owner=usb rx=23073 tx=821709 overflow=0 errors=0 tx_rejected=597; x=claim while stopped

HOST_TX ?t
[ENCODER_SPEED] encoder3 LEFT C3/C4, encoder4 RIGHT C5/C25; vendor PULSE_DIR counting; @encoder_status; @encoder_hw; @encoder_sign s3 s4; @speed_cfg max_ticks kp ki; @speed_mode 0/1; PI OFF by default
[MOTION_DIAG] max 150 permille; manual profile required; no auto-start; ramp 100 permille/s; h every 100ms, !=STOP
[THRESHOLD_DIAG] manual single-wheel bench; first <=100, step <=10, max 200 permille / 1500ms; local autostart disabled; !=STOP
[MOTION] @motion line/shuttle permille ms; @motion circle permille ms pulse_us; requires hardware calibration, cruise=0; h heartbeat, !=STOP, v=confirm reverse while stopped

[VISION2] MIDTERM: camera steering / open-loop motor; UART arm/stop; physical keys removed; boot is stopped
[DRIVE] a=REMOTE arm h=REMOTE heartbeat s=STOP c=clear; s/!/image/pause/reset disarms
[FIELD] build=PHASE2_VISUAL_TRACE_20261109_1; @status, @gain kp kd kh, @motor cruise cap rise, @camera near far, @bands near_y far_y half, @servo center min max sign, @motor_dir level1 level2, @duration ms; newline; !=STOP
[OPENLOOP] @balance motor1_scale motor2_scale; 0..1 attenuation; no encoders; PWM is NOT measured speed
[STARTUP] @startup enabled delay_ms; @save, @load; physical keys removed; boot does not auto-arm; remote a requires h heartbeat
[PROBE] @probe pulse_us hold_ms; bench only; motors zero; first 1500us then <=50us step; STOP/timeout off
[WHEEL] @wheel channel permille level hold_ms; lifted bench only; one motor; <=200 permille / 1500ms; NOT forward confirmation
[LINK] dual UART1/UART8 115200 8N1; x=claim this port while stopped; !=STOP on either port
[MODE] C26/C27 ON=ground: 00 OBSERVE, 10 SERVO, 01 MOTOR, 11 DRIVE; change=STOP; keys removed; a/h/s via UART
[VISION2] t=text g=gray b=binary o=overlay p=pause r=reset ?=help
[BAYES] f=full-track observer (NO DRIVE), m=midterm control; both stop/reset
[BAYES] default model UNTRAINED; posterior is not measured accuracy
[VISION2] image: SeekFree V2, GRAY 94x60, header=12 bytes; no mixed text
[VISION2] err>0 means lane is RIGHT; valid=0 means DO NOT use err for control

